B. q-witness covering repairs of AP_N: drop d, add minimal repair w
================================================================================================
Rows cover every q=2..N, so THM-523's easy witness is disabled.
The comparison line N=14 is included to show the first-open contrast.
This is an AP-drop repair slice, not a global covering-set minimization.

